  and {{rq1.section3_auto_share}} in the governance section, and at control level the
  semi-automatable class dominates ({{rq1.controls_semi_share}}). Moving a use case up a
  six-rung autonomy ladder enlarges its control set monotonically yet rarely changes its tier.
