  {{rq3.asr_none}} to {{rq3.asr_layered}} also refused {{rq3.over_refusal_layered}} of benign
  in-scope requests, so no pattern met both pre-registered thresholds. No single framework fully
  covers more than {{rq4.best_single_framework_share}} of expectations; the union of ISO/IEC
  42001, the NIST AI RMF and the EU AI Act leaves {{rq4.union_residue_share}} without a full
  mapping, and the residue is governance machinery and Singapore-specific proportionality rather
  than the agent-specific clauses we predicted. Evidence volume is flat across materiality tiers
  ({{rq5.critical_evidence_items}} items at Critical against {{rq5.medium_evidence_items}} at
  Medium): proportionality scales the rigour of review, not the number of artefacts, and
  {{rq5.semi_doc_effort_share}} of estimated effort lies in work that automation cannot finish.
